    "Register your interest": "登记您的意向",
    "What Chinese buyers look for in African tea": "中国买家在非洲茶叶中寻找什么",
    "For exporters weighing whether the Chinese market is worth the effort.": "为正在权衡中国市场是否值得投入的出口商提供参考。",
    "Kenya sells around two per cent of its tea exports to China, against 36 per\ncent to Pakistan (<a href=\"https://www.teaboard.or.ke/images/downloads/performance-highlights/TEA-INDUSTRY-PERFORMANCE-REPORT-2025.pdf\">Tea Board of Kenya, 2025</a>).\nPart of that gap is access. Part of it is that the two markets want different\nproducts.": "肯尼亚向中国出口的茶叶约占其茶叶出口总量的2%,而向巴基斯坦出口的占36%(<a href=\"https://www.teaboard.or.ke/images/downloads/performance-highlights/TEA-INDUSTRY-PERFORMANCE-REPORT-2025.pdf\">肯尼亚茶叶局,2025</a>)。这一差距部分源于市场准入问题,部分源于两个市场对不同产品的需求。",
    "Orthodox and CTC are not interchangeable": "传统工艺茶与CTC茶不可互换",
    "Most Kenyan black tea is CTC: cut, tear, curl. It brews fast, takes milk well\nand suits the strong-cup habit of Kenya's largest export markets.": "大多数肯尼亚红茶采用CTC工艺:切碎、撕裂、卷曲。这种茶冲泡快速,适合加奶,符合肯尼亚最大出口市场对浓茶的饮用习惯。",
    "Chinese consumption is built around leaf tea brewed without milk, where the\nappearance of the dry leaf and the character of the liquor both matter to the\nbuyer. An exporter approaching China with a CTC portfolio alone is offering a\nproduct shaped for a different drinking culture.": "中国的茶叶消费建立在不加奶冲泡的叶茶基础上,干茶的外观和茶汤的品质特征对买家都很重要。仅凭CTC产品组合来开拓中国市场的出口商,提供的是为不同饮茶文化塑造的产品。",
    "This is not a barrier so much as a specification. Kenya produces orthodox and\nspecialty tea, and purple tea is a genuinely distinctive product with no direct\nequivalent elsewhere.": "这与其说是障碍,不如说是规格要求。肯尼亚生产传统工艺茶和特种茶,紫茶是一种真正独特的产品,在其他地方没有直接的同类产品。",
    "Grade consistency over grade height": "等级稳定性胜过等级高度",
    "A recurring theme in buyer conversations is that consistency beats peak\nquality. An importer building a branded product needs the same cup across\nrepeat shipments more than an exceptional single lot.": "买家对话中反复出现的主题是稳定性胜过峰值品质。建立品牌产品的进口商需要的是重复发货时相同的茶汤品质,而不是一批特别出色的单品。",
    "That favours suppliers who can document their process rather than those who can\nshow their best sample.": "这有利于那些能够记录其流程的供应商,而非那些能够展示其最佳样品的供应商。",
    "Packaging and channel": "包装与渠道",
    "Packaging that suits a bulk auction buyer does not suit an importer supplying\nretail or e-commerce. Where the tea ends up determines the format, and the\nformat is usually decided before the price.": "适合大宗拍卖买家的包装并不适合供应零售或电子商务的进口商。茶叶的最终去向决定了包装形式,而包装形式通常在价格确定之前就已决定。",
    "Traceability": "可追溯性",
    "Origin documentation, certification and the ability to trace a lot back to a\nfactory and a picking period are increasingly a condition of the conversation\nrather than a premium feature.": "原产地文件、认证以及将批次追溯至工厂和采摘时期的能力,日益成为洽谈的前提条件,而非溢价特征。",
    "The practical answer": "实际答案",
    "Every point above is settled between a specific buyer and a specific supplier,\nnot in general. That is what the Investment Forum and the B2B meetings on Day 2\nare for, and what the <a href=\"/exhibition/\">expo</a> on Day 3 puts on a table.": "上述每一点都是在特定买家与特定供应商之间解决的,而非泛泛而谈。这正是第2天投资论坛和B2B会议的目的,也是第3天<a href=\"/exhibition/\">展览会</a>摆上台面的内容。",
    "Detail on the sessions is published in phases. This piece is background written\nfrom public industry sources and should not be read as a summit position on any\ngrade or market.": "会议详情分阶段发布。本文是根据公开行业资料撰写的背景信息,不应被解读为峰会对任何等级或市场的立场。",
